        "lyrics": "[00:02.00]Oh…\n[00:04.50]Yeah…\n\n[00:08.00]I was searching through the noise inside\n[00:13.00]Trying just to feel something alive\n[00:18.00]Every road I took just led me back\n[00:23.00]To a place I didn’t understand\n\n[00:28.00]Then You found me in the silence\n[00:33.00]Like a voice I couldn’t outrun\n\n[00:39.00]Now I’m standing in a different light\n[00:44.00]Something in me finally came alive\n[00:48.50]All the weight I carried fades away\n[00:53.00]When I feel Your presence near\n\n[00:58.00]I don’t need to have it figured out\n[01:03.00]You’re the peace I never knew I found\n[01:08.00]Through the highs and all the in-between\n[01:12.50]I know You are here with me\n\n[01:19.00]Every shadow tried to pull me down\n[01:24.00]Every doubt was getting way too loud\n[01:28.50]But Your love was steady through it all\n[01:33.00]Like a fire I could always follow\n\n[01:38.50]Even when I couldn’t see it\n[01:43.00]You were working in the dark\n\n[01:49.00]Now I’m standing in a different light\n[01:54.00]Something in me finally came alive\n[01:58.50]All the weight I carried fades away\n[02:03.00]When I feel Your presence near\n\n[02:10.00]You never left, You never let go\n[02:14.50]Closer than I’ve ever known\n[02:19.00]Through every high, through every low\n[02:24.00]You were there all along\n\n[02:29.00]You never left, You never let go\n[02:33.50]Now I see what I couldn’t before\n[02:38.00]Every step, every road\n[02:43.00]Led me right back to Your love\n\n[02:50.00]Now I’m standing in a different light\n[02:55.00]Everything is clearer in my eyes\n[03:00.00]All the fear is slowly washed away\n[03:04.50]‘Cause I know I’m not alone\n\n[03:12.00](Soft, fading)\n[03:18.00]You were there…\n[03:24.00]All along…\n[03:30.00]You were there…\n[03:36.00]All along…",
