        "lyrics": "[Intro]\n\n\n(Drums + claps)\nOh-oh-oh!\nWe lift You high, Jesus!\n\n[Verse 1]\nI was lost in the dark, You called my name\nThrough the night, You broke every chain\nNow I’m living in the light of grace\nJesus, You have made a way\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nEvery fear falls at Your feet\nEvery heart finds hope in You\n\n[Chorus]\nJesus, we lift Your name up high\nGod, You reign, forever glorified\nWe are free ‘cause You gave Your life\nWe will praise You all our days\n\nJesus, You’re the reason why\nHearts come alive, darkness has to hide\nWe won’t stop, we won’t be silent\nWe will praise Your holy name\n\n[Verse 2]\nEvery wall that stood against Your truth\nCame crashing down when we called on You\nNow we stand in the power of Your name\nJesus, You will never change\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nEvery chain is broken now\nBy the power of Your love\n\n[Chorus]\nJesus, we lift Your name up high\nGod, You reign, forever glorified\nWe are free ‘cause You gave Your life\nWe will praise You all our days\n\n[Bridge] (BIG BUILD)\n(Repeat, build intensity)\nThere’s power in the name of Jesus\nThere’s freedom in the name of Jesus\nThere’s healing in the name of Jesus\nWe believe it, we believe it\n\nThere’s power in the name of Jesus\nChains are breaking in the name of Jesus\nEvery victory in the name of Jesus\nWe believe it, we believe it\n\n[Final Chorus] (FULL, HUGE)\nJesus, we lift Your name up high\nGod, You reign, forever glorified\nWe are free ‘cause You gave Your life\nWe will praise You all our days\n\n(Ad-libs)\nHallelujah! Jesus! We praise You!\n\n[Outro]\n\n\n(Chant)\nJesus! Jesus!\nWe lift You high!\n\n[Verse 1]\nI was lost in the dark, You called my name\nThrough the night, You broke every chain\nNow I’m living in the light of grace\nJesus, You have made a way\nNow we stand in the power of Your name\nJesus, You will never change\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nEvery chain is broken now\nBy the power of Your love\n\n[Chorus]\nJesus, we lift Your name up high\nGod, You reign, forever glorified\nWe are free ‘cause You gave Your life\nWe will praise You all our days\n\n[Bridge] (BIG BUILD)\n(Repeat, build intensity)\nThere’s power in the name of Jesus\nThere’s freedom in the name of Jesus\nThere’s healing in the name of Jesus\nWe believe it, we believe it\n\nThere’s power in the name of Jesus\nChains are breaking in the name of Jesus\nEvery victory in the name of Jesus\nWe believe it, we believe it\n\n[Final Chorus] (FULL, HUGE)\nJesus, we lift Your name up high\nGod, You reign, forever glorified\nWe are free ‘cause You gave Your life\nWe will praise You all our days\n\n(Ad-libs)\nHallelujah! Jesus! We praise You!\n\n[Outro]\n\n\n(Chant)\nJesus! Jesus!\nWe lift You high!\n\n(Drums + claps)\nOh-oh-oh!\nWe lift You high, Jesus",
